WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.200
An invented disease: one in
a hundred people have it.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.180
A test is positive for ninety-five
per cent of people who have it,

3
00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.720
and negative for ninety-five
per cent of people who don't.

4
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.020
You take the test.

5
00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.140
The result card flips over.

6
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.540
So how likely is it
that you really have it?

7
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.720
In this mission, you'll draw
the tree: disease or not first,

8
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.280
then the test result.

9
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.530
And you'll use Bayes' theorem, which
reverses a conditional probability,

10
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.550
to work from the result back to the cause.

11
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.130
Your mission: decide whether a positive
result means you are likely ill.
